ES:
Echarle {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}pescado {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}a una ensalada
es una gran idea,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} salvo para aquellos
que son finos de hocico...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} ¡o de pico!
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}¡No hay nada que temer!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Unas gotas
de vinagre enmascararán el olor del
pescado sin alterar su sabor.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Como el pescado es muy suave, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}necesitarás echarle algo de {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}limón{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
para realzar el sabor, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}. 
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Le dará un ligero toque cítrico{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
que hará la ensalada más apetitosa.

EN:
You can greatly change the taste of
soup with {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}fish{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} in it by simply adding
something to temper the flavor.
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Perhaps something like the sweet, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
citrusy flavor of some types of fruit
would work{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I'm obsessed with it!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} That citrusy
smell{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}. It's a lifesaver{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}. {{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}That's right! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}If you add a bit of
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}lemon{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}, the fishy smell is obliterated.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
This makes it easier to eat.

IT:
Puoi rendere il sapore della{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}} zuppa
di {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}pesce{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}stufata{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} un po' più delicato
usando un ingrediente segreto.
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Credo che un sapore dolce{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
e aromatico come quello degli
agrumi sia quello che ci vuole{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
L'aroma degli agrumi{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} mi fa
impazzire{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}. E risolve ogni piatto{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}. {{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Esatto! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Aggiungi un po' di {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}limone
{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}e l'odore di pesce scomparirà.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
E la tua zuppa sarà un successone!

